  "description": "<p>This Bigfoot area rug brings a unique outdoor adventure theme to your living space. Featuring a detailed Sasquatch design, this rug is ideal for adding personality and rustic charm. It is designed for indoor use, providing both comfort and a touch of wilderness to any room.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features a detailed Sasquatch design for an adventurous theme.</li>\n<li>Adds rustic charm to various indoor settings.</li>\n<li>Constructed with durable materials for longevity.</li>\n<li>Equipped with a non-slip backing for safety.</li>\n<li>Offers a soft surface for a cozy underfoot feel.</li>\n<li>Designed for easy maintenance with simple cleaning methods.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Machine-Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Living Room, Bedroom, Cabin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Not Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Bigfoot</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Bigfoot</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Rustic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Sponge - Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>High-quality Epoxy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Spot Clean Only</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Regular vacuuming or gentle washing</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This area rug is suitable for various indoor spaces, including living rooms, bedrooms, and cabins. Its unique design and rustic style make it a perfect addition for nature lovers and those looking to infuse an adventurous touch into their home décor.</p>",
